ARM GAS  /tmp/ccqiEoki.s 			page 4


 145:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   *
 146:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c **** @verbatim   
 147:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****  ===============================================================================
 148:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****                   ##### Backup Domain Access function #####
 149:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****  ===============================================================================  
 150:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****     [..]
 151:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****       After reset, the backup domain (RTC registers, RTC backup data 
 152:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****       registers and backup SRAM) is protected against possible unwanted 
 153:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****       write accesses. 
 154:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****       To enable access to the RTC Domain and RTC registers, proceed as follows:
 155:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****         (+) Enable the Power Controller (PWR) APB1 interface clock using the
 156:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****             RCC_APB1PeriphClockCmd() function.
 157:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****         (+) Enable access to RTC domain using the PWR_BackupAccessCmd() function.
 158:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c **** 
 159:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c **** @endverbatim
 160:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   * @{
 161:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   */
 162:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c **** 
