 653:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****     [..]
 654:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****       (+) By setting the FPDS bit in the PWR_CR register by using the 
 655:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****           PWR_FlashPowerDownCmd() function, the Flash memory also enters power 
 656:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****           down mode when the device enters Stop mode. When the Flash memory 
 657:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****           is in power down mode, an additional startup delay is incurred when 
 658:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****           waking up from Stop mode.
 659:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c **** @endverbatim
 660:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   * @{
 661:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   */
