 919:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   *          - Reset pad (still available) 
 920:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   *          - RTC_AF1 pin (PC13) if configured for tamper, time-stamp, RTC 
 921:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   *            Alarm out, or RTC clock calibration out.
