 923:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   *          - WKUP pin 1 (PA0) if enabled.
 924:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_pwr.c ****   * @note   The Wakeup flag (WUF) need to be cleared at application level before to call this funct
